@main
// F3: dynamic division by zero must fail loudly (stderr + exit 1) on every
// target — bootstrap and gen1 both route Div/Mod zero through the shared
// _rt_div_zero helper (mirrored in xurt and rt.xu), so no SIGFPE or silent
// platform variance. `%` covers the mod guard here; `/` is exercised by
// tests/fixtures/div_zero_loud (same lowering on both operators).
// Gen1 ≡ bootstrap observable behavior (§6 dual-table compare).
fn main() int {
    a := 7
    d := a - 7
    c := 5 % d
    println(c)
    << 0
}
